[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_afksn")
dialogue_id = "debate_investment"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Ancestral Legacy"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: Consider a village where the springs have suddenly run dry.
scribe: To survive, the people decide to dig a new well.
scribe: The first generation digs up the soil until their shovels can go no deeper.
scribe: The second generation makes pickaxes to break the rocks and hauls them up, basket by basket.
scribe: Now the third generation stands at the bottom of the pit.
scribe: The work is agonizing, but the stone is finally damp.
scribe: It would be so very easy for them to throw down their tools, and say the work is too difficult to continue.
scribe: But if they stop, they do not merely accept their own thirst.
scribe: They accept that their parents and grandparents suffered in the dark for nothing.
scribe: We are that third generation.
scribe: The Enlightened One saved our ancestors from destruction, and they accepted that miracle with a promise to make the world whole again.
scribe: We carry centuries of their sacrifices on our shoulders.
scribe: We have no right to simply shrug them off."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
